sequenceDiagram
    participant User as End User
    participant App as FireFly App
    participant Auth as better-auth
    participant Okta as Okta IDP
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over User,DB: User Registration Flow

    User->>App: Visit /sso-spn/login
    App->>Auth: Check for existing session
    Auth-->>App: No session found
    App-->>User: Redirect to Okta login

    User->>Okta: Enter credentials
    Okta->>Okta: Validate credentials
    Okta-->>User: Return authorization code

    User->>Auth: /api/auth/callback with code
    Auth->>Okta: Exchange code for tokens
    Okta-->>Auth: Access token + ID token

    Auth->>DB: Check if user exists
    alt User does not exist
        Auth->>DB: INSERT into user table
        Note right of Auth: Create new user record
        Auth->>DB: INSERT into account table
        Note right of Auth: Link OAuth account
    else User exists
        Auth->>DB: UPDATE account tokens
    end

    Auth->>DB: INSERT into session table
    Auth-->>User: Set session cookie
    User->>App: Redirect to /sso-spn/select-org
